WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.264 --> 00:00:05.168
It's a very harsh weather out here,
very unpredictable.

00:00:05.802 --> 00:00:09.072
Takes a lot of time
and effort to have everything ready

00:00:09.072 --> 00:00:09.806
for the winter.

00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:14.544
Ready? Yeah.

00:00:14.544 --> 00:00:18.147
Well pull up maybe,
uh, pull the side out first, this way.

00:00:19.115 --> 00:00:21.050
Go on this side, and I’ll go on this side.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.724
This is the sled I’m going to be working
on, so we can have something to carry

00:00:27.724 --> 00:00:29.859
all our equipment
and stuff down to the beach.

00:00:32.061 --> 00:00:34.397
And I've been working on it for a while

00:00:34.397 --> 00:00:38.601
since my last school year.I
just graduated last year and it’s

00:00:38.601 --> 00:00:41.804
really good to have these things
ready before winter comes.

00:00:42.438 --> 00:00:43.973
It would be really hard without this.

00:00:46.042 --> 00:00:46.442
Okay, uh,

00:00:46.442 --> 00:00:48.011
get the Skil saw, see

00:00:48.011 --> 00:00:51.047
if we can cut out the,
uh, three inches, huh?

00:00:51.047 --> 00:00:51.447
Yeah.

00:00:52.115 --> 00:00:55.218
Try to get two on each side, that way
it'll be thick enough to use

00:00:55.618 --> 00:00:56.452
throughout the winter.

00:01:10.433 --> 00:01:11.901
Everything is hard to get out here.

00:01:12.835 --> 00:01:15.004
You know, we’re in a remote village.

00:01:15.004 --> 00:01:17.340
Whatever we can get a hold of,
we try to hold onto.

00:01:19.575 --> 00:01:20.810
Try not to waste anything. 

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:29.285
Let’s see, huh? See if it works.

00:01:31.087 --> 00:01:34.490
Tried to even it out
and, uh, looks good, huh?

00:01:34.757 --> 00:01:35.725
Yeah.

00:01:35.992 --> 00:01:37.694
How much are sticking out?

00:01:37.694 --> 00:01:40.029
Got about an inch to work with.

00:01:40.029 --> 00:01:40.797
That’s good.

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.869
Right after this garage was built,
I put in my wood

00:01:46.869 --> 00:01:49.806
stove that I made at school last year.

00:01:50.673 --> 00:01:52.742
I've been working on a lot of things
in here.

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:55.912
Growing up, my dad taught me

00:01:55.912 --> 00:01:58.081
how to make things.

00:01:59.982 --> 00:02:04.120
We're gonna, uh, put bolts on the front
end there to secure the sled.

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:11.027
Move back a little ways
and kind of go at an angle this way.

00:02:11.027 --> 00:02:12.061
This way?

00:02:19.802 --> 00:02:22.905
you hit a screw and tried in here,
I think. Ahh.

00:02:43.593 --> 00:02:44.727
Hey,

00:02:45.628 --> 00:02:46.896
we're in business.

00:02:50.533 --> 00:02:54.070
Man, I can’t wait to see this,
uh, brand new sled in use.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:55.638
I know.

00:02:55.638 --> 00:02:57.273
These sleds are hard to come by.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:01.811
Yeah.

00:03:01.811 --> 00:03:06.215
You know, wintertime is just around
the corner, getting colder and windier.

00:03:06.516 --> 00:03:08.551
It’s
a little bit harder to hunt from land.

00:03:09.886 --> 00:03:12.188
We’re
gonna have a sled Looking for the game.

00:03:14.457 --> 00:03:19.462
Walrus, whales, and

00:03:19.462 --> 00:03:22.698
all the other marine mammals
that come along with the ice.

00:03:22.698 --> 00:03:24.367
They're gonna be plentiful.

00:03:27.603 --> 00:03:29.338
Hey.

00:03:29.338 --> 00:03:31.941
Gotta use different part of the house
to bend it

00:03:33.276 --> 00:03:35.211
improvise and adapt.

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:42.385
Hey, we're done.

00:03:46.122 --> 00:03:47.390
We’re in business.

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:50.426
The weather has been a big factor

00:03:50.426 --> 00:03:54.030
and we've had a poor season
this past year.

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:56.465
We gotta prepare for it.

00:04:01.704 --> 00:04:04.874
you gotta take what life gives you.

00:04:06.709 --> 00:04:07.877
Try to make adjustments,

00:04:08.911 --> 00:04:10.746
basically go with the weather.

00:04:19.655 --> 00:04:22.024
Shouldn’t be too long to finish it now.

00:04:22.291 --> 00:04:23.125
Yeah.

